#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2227
msgid "Min-Max Plots"
msgstr "Min/max-diagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2321
msgid "A single textual entry labeling the data series."
msgstr "Ett textvärde som namnger dataserien."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2396
msgid "Polar Plots"
msgstr "Polardiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2433
msgid ""
"Radar plot styles provide three choices for the rendering of the chart. The "
"first style presents the radar chart as only a polygon of lines. The second "
"style also includes a marker where the data values are plotted on each axis."
" The third style plots the radar chart as a filled polygon."
msgstr ""
"Radardiagram har tre stilar. Den första visar enbart polygonens linjer. Den "
"andra lägger till en markör där varje värde placeras på sin axel. Den tredje"
" visar polygonen fylld."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2451
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a worksheet area showing a data table and three radar charts"
" made using those data."
msgstr ""
"En skärmbild av ett område i kalkylbladet med en datatabell och tre "
"radardiagram som skapats utifrån värdena."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2516
msgid ""
"A series of textual elements labeling each value. Generally, this series "
"will have as many entries as there were in the 'Value' series."
msgstr ""
"En lista med textvärden som namnger varje värde. Vanligtvis har listan lika "
"många poster som värdeserien."
